-----------
 issuepack
-----------

Pack issues into your repo.

```sh
uv tool install .
issuepack new "Fix login redirect" -m "Return to the original page after login."
issuepack ls (--status closed)
issuepack ls "login redirect"
issuepack ls "original page" --status closed
issuepack edit 1
issuepack edit 1 --status closed
issuepack help edit
```

An optional search string for `ls` matches literal text in titles and descriptions,
ignoring case. Searches show open issues by default; use `--status closed` for
closed issues. Searches read the issue files directly without storing an index.
